feat(memory): Phase 1 — staging in prompt + staged_boundary foundation

- get_memory_context() now includes STAGING.md (pending-synthesis tier),
  making consolidation output immediately and cross-session visible.
- Session gains staged_boundary (idempotency watermark: everything before
  it is already distilled into STAGING.md) with load-time migration from
  last_consolidated, persistence in the JSONL metadata line, and pointer
  adjustment in retain_recent_legal_suffix().
- Add Session.context_prefix_len() tag-scan: the pinned context prefix is
  derived from _session_context/_compact_summary tags, not a stored pointer.
- PLAN_unified_consolidation.md updated to v2: single-pointer model,
  3-case consolidation dispatch (free-drop / commit+drop / stage-only),
  /stage command, D1-D10 design decisions.

last_consolidated is retained (deprecated) until the Phase 3 removal.
